    <text x="145" y="284" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21" fill="#f8e4df">decides the story</text>
    <line x1="290" y1="230" x2="380" y2="230" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="4" marker-end="url(#b)"/>
    <g font-size="23">
      <rect x="390" y="20" width="300" height="120" fill="#e2eedf" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="2"/><text x="540" y="70" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Correspondent</text><text x="540" y="104" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">watches the beat</text>
      <rect x="390" y="170" width="300" height="120" fill="#e2eedf" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="2"/><text x="540" y="220" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Researcher</text><text x="540" y="254" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">the public record</text>
      <rect x="390" y="320" width="300" height="120" fill="#e2eedf" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="2"/><text x="540" y="370" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Ontologist</text><text x="540" y="404" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">who is who, the graph</text>
      <line x1="690" y1="80" x2="790" y2="230" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="690" y1="230" x2="790" y2="230" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="690" y1="380" x2="790" y2="230" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="2"/>
      <rect x="800" y="150" width="280" height="160" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="3"/><text x="940" y="214" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Journalist agent</text><text x="940" y="248" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">drafts, sources each fact,</text><text x="940" y="276" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">signs it</text>
      <line x1="1080" y1="230" x2="1170" y2="230" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="4" marker-end="url(#b)"/>
      <rect x="1180" y="150" width="220" height="160" fill="#121317"/><text x="1290" y="218" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600" fill="#f6f3ec">The gate</text><text x="1290" y="252" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#c8c4ba">checks, refuses</text><text x="1290" y="278" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#c8c4ba">the unsigned</text>
      <line x1="1400" y1="230" x2="1470" y2="230" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="4" marker-end="url(#b)"/>
      <rect x="1480" y="150" width="190" height="160" fill="#006600"/><text x="1575" y="218" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600" fill="#fff">Published</text><text x="1575" y="252" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#e2eedf">live, public,</text><text x="1575" y="278" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#e2eedf">versioned</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <div class="cols" style="margin-top:20px;gap:40px">
    <div class="card r" style="padding:26px 30px"><div class="n">JOURNALISTS · VERY TECHNICAL</div><p>Editorial: the line, the beats (Portugal, Europe, AI, the summit), the interviews and the judgement no agent has.</p></div>
    <div class="card c" style="padding:26px 30px"><div class="n">STRATEGIC PEOPLE · HIRED WITH EQUITY</div><p>"We now have our first execution execs, but we don't have strategic people." Market, products, partners, the next level.</p></div>
