<!-- 9 · the team today -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The team today</b></span><span>09</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Gen Z and Gen X, already working together</div>
  <h2>What is missing is a couple of experienced people from the industry.</h2>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1680 420" width="1680" height="420" style="margin-top:50px">
    <!-- generations axis -->
    <line x1="0" y1="330" x2="1680" y2="330" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="3"/>
    <text x="0" y="372" class="mono" font-size="19" fill="#595c64" letter-spacing="2">GEN Z · NEW TOOLS, NEW HABITS</text>
    <text x="1680" y="372" class="mono" font-size="19" fill="#595c64" letter-spacing="2" text-anchor="end">GEN X · DECADES OF PRACTICE</text>
    <!-- Gen Z cluster -->
    <g fill="#006600"><circle cx="120" cy="250" r="34"/><circle cx="210" cy="230" r="34"/><circle cx="300" cy="255" r="34"/><circle cx="390" cy="232" r="34"/><circle cx="165" cy="160" r="34"/><circle cx="345" cy="160" r="34"/></g>
    <text x="255" y="90" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600" fill="#006600">Gen Z</text>
    <text x="255" y="122" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">in the team today</text>
    <!-- Gen X -->
    <g fill="#121317"><circle cx="1460" cy="245" r="34"/><circle cx="1550" cy="230" r="34"/></g>
    <text x="1500" y="160" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Gen X</text>
    <text x="1500" y="192" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">in the team today</text>
    <!-- the empty seats -->
    <g fill="#f8e4df" stroke="#c52830" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="10 8"><circle cx="1050" cy="245" r="42"/><circle cx="1170" cy="245" r="42"/></g>
    <text x="1110" y="252" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="40" font-weight="600" fill="#c52830">?</text>
    <text x="1110" y="132" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600" fill="#c52830">You</text>
    <text x="1110" y="164" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">experienced, from the industry</text>
    <!-- bridges -->
    <path d="M430 240 C 650 180, 850 200, 1000 240" fill="none" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="6 8"/>
    <path d="M1215 245 L1420 245" fill="none" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="6 8"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="cols c3" style="margin-top:30px;gap:36px">
    <div class="stat"><div class="v" style="font-size:72px">7</div><div class="l">people at the summit, the front-end team</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="v" style="font-size:72px">Unpaid</div><div class="l">"a massive win-win where they are learning a lot"</div></div>
    <div class="stat r"><div class="v" style="font-size:72px">Fast</div><div class="l">onboarding: "once we have funds, we can just accelerate"</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="src">Dinis Cruz, 7 November 2026. No team member is named here but the founder. Dots are illustrative, not a headcount.</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>Join us</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 10 · Gen ZX founders -->
<section class="slide v ink">
  <div class="head"><span><b>Gen ZX founders</b></span><span>10</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">In Dinis Cruz's words</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:96px">Gen ZX founders: <span style="color:#8fd18f">that's who we're looking for.</span></h2>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1680 200" width="1680" height="200" style="margin-top:60px">
    <rect x="0" y="40" width="560" height="120" fill="#006600"/><text x="280" y="114" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="46" font-weight="600" fill="#fff">Gen Z</text>
    <text x="700" y="118" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="70" font-weight="600" fill="#8fd18f">+</text>
    <rect x="840" y="40" width="560" height="120" fill="#f6f3ec"/><text x="1120" y="114" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="46" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Gen X</text>
    <text x="1460" y="118" class="serif" font-size="70" font-weight="600" fill="#8fd18f">=</text>
    <text x="1540" y="114" class="serif" font-size="46" font-weight="600" fill="#ff7a7f">ZX</text>
  </svg>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:40px">Gen Z and Gen X, together, founding. <b>The team today is that mix; what it needs now is a couple of experienced people from the industry.</b></p>
  <p class="lead" style="font-size:26px;margin-top:30px">Dinis Cruz's book and presentation on Gen ZX founders: the link will be added here when it is published.</p>
  <div class="src" style="color:#9a978f">Dinis Cruz, 7 November 2026. His thesis is in the book, not restated here.</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>Join us</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 11 · how it would work -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>How it would work</b></span><span>11</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Start by helping, visibly. Then join. Then the stake.</div>
  <h2>The future partners and team come from the people already involved.</h2>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1680 400" width="1680" height="400" style="margin-top:40px">
    <defs><marker id="c" markerWidth="12" markerHeight="12" refX="10" refY="6" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L12,6 L0,12 z" fill="#006600"/></marker></defs>
    <!-- staircase -->
    <rect x="0" y="260" width="520" height="140" fill="#e2eedf" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="3"/>
    <rect x="560" y="140" width="520" height="260" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="3"/>
    <rect x="1120" y="20" width="560" height="380" fill="#006600"/>
    <text x="30" y="306" class="serif" font-size="50" font-weight="600" fill="#006600">1</text>
    <text x="80" y="304" class="serif" font-size="34" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Help now</text>
    <text x="30" y="346" font-size="22" fill="#3f424a">this summit week, unpaid, in public:</text>
    <text x="30" y="376" font-size="22" fill="#3f424a">your work is on the record, with your role</text>
    <text x="590" y="186" class="serif" font-size="50" font-weight="600" fill="#006600">2</text>
    <text x="640" y="184" class="serif" font-size="34" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Join officially</text>
    <text x="590" y="226" font-size="22" fill="#3f424a">a named role in the team:</text>
    <text x="590" y="256" font-size="22" fill="#3f424a">CEO, journalist, strategist,</text>
    <text x="590" y="286" font-size="22" fill="#3f424a">part of the founding team</text>
    <text x="1150" y="66" class="serif" font-size="50" font-weight="600" fill="#8fd18f">3</text>
    <text x="1200" y="64" class="serif" font-size="34" font-weight="600" fill="#fff">When investment comes</text>
    <text x="1150" y="106" font-size="22" fill="#e2eedf">everyone has a stake and is paid:</text>
    <text x="1150" y="136" font-size="22" fill="#e2eedf">growth shares, or according to</text>
    <text x="1150" y="166" font-size="22" fill="#e2eedf">how each person comes in</text>
    <path d="M300 250 C 380 180, 460 160, 550 170" fill="none" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="4" marker-end="url(#c)"/>
    <path d="M860 130 C 940 60, 1020 50, 1110 55" fill="none" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="4" marker-end="url(#c)"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="quote-s" style="margin-top:40px">"If somebody is not interested enough to be involved right now, are they only going to flip when they have equity? I don't like that."<span class="by">Dinis Cruz, 7 November 2026</span></div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>Join us</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 12 · the stake -->
<section class="slide v">
  <div class="head"><span><b>What is in it for you</b></span><span>12</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Everybody has a stake in the game</div>
  <h2>When investment comes, everyone is paid and everyone owns a part.</h2>
  <div class="cols c3" style="margin-top:60px">
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">THE STAKE</div><h3>Growth shares</h3><p>Shares for the core team that vest on milestones and come alive at a future date or on a sale, like the growth shares used at a UK company Dinis worked with; or according to how each person comes in.</p></div>
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">THE PAY</div><h3>Paid, then accelerate</h3><p>Investors buy equity in the company. The money is for the operations: commercialisation, services, and editorial, hiring journalists.</p></div>
    <div class="card r"><div class="n">THE HONEST PART</div><h3>No numbers yet</h3><p>The split is to be decided. No one has been promised anything: "only when somebody puts money on the table can you have a more serious conversation".</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:56px">"Everybody will have equity, growth shares or depending how they come in; everybody has a stake in the game, everybody will be paid, and then we accelerate." <b>"This is our recruitment."</b></p>
  <div class="src">Dinis Cruz, 7 November 2026. No amount, valuation or split is given in this deck.</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>Join us</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 13 · start this week -->
<section class="slide">
