  <div class="cols w60 center" style="margin-top:0;height:100%">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker red">Web Summit Lisbon · 9 to 12 November 2026</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:66px">Be the back office behind, and beside, the seven at the summit.</h2>
      <ul class="ticks" style="margin-top:40px">
        <li><b>From anywhere:</b> the newsroom is online and in public; you do not need to be in Lisbon.</li>
        <li><b>With the team:</b> the seven on the floor, the agents behind them, and you in between.</li>
        <li><b>Unpaid, with visibility:</b> your role and your work on the record.</li>
        <li><b>Learning a lot:</b> how an agentic newsroom runs a live event, from the inside.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="lead" style="font-size:28px;margin-top:30px"><b>The validation is Web Summit.</b> The people who help make it work are the people we want to build the company with.</p>
